&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Our &lt;a class=&quot;ring-ui-link_f850&quot; href=&quot;https://lp.jetbrains.com/research/software-engineering/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Software Engineering Research Department&lt;/a&gt; focuses on integrating scientific innovation into JetBrains products. Leveraging our expertise in research and academic collaborations, we ensure our tools remain at the forefront of technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a diligent and proactive individual to join us, helping to streamline our operations and foster closer collaboration between JetBrains teams. By taking on organizational responsibilities, you&#39;ll enable our tech specialists to concentrate on driving innovation and adding even more value to the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Project Manager for our Research Department, you&#39;ll play a central role in the department&#39;s core activities. Here’s a quick glance at your responsibilities:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-tight=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process management:&lt;/strong&gt; Crafting and maintaining robust processes to ensure our projects deliver research outcomes efficiently and consistently, even when dealing with the inherent unpredictability of research — from evolving goals and unexpected outcomes to shifting requirements and unforeseen technical challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support across projects:&lt;/strong&gt; Providing comprehensive support to teams across various projects, handling administrative, organizational, and legal tasks to ensure smooth operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promoting transparency and collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Acting as a bridge for transparent and collaborative relationships between our team and other stakeholders involved in our projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication facilitation:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilizing communication channels effectively to synchronize efforts and ensure alignment among all stakeholders, keeping everyone informed and engaged.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thorough task analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Delving deep into project tasks, meticulously analyzing and verifying their completeness and accuracy to set the stage for success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you should bring to the table:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-tight=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process management mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated expertise in setting up and managing processes to navigate projects with high levels of uncertainty, ensuring both timeliness and quality. Knowledge of SDLC and frameworks is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical background:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of ML and AI principles. Ability to facilitate technical discussions and identify potential risks and challenges associated with ML/AI projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent communication skills in English, both verbal and written, with a talent for facilitating seamless information flow and fostering alignment among diverse stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical rigor:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong analytical capabilities, enabling you to dive deep into project tasks, ensuring meticulous definition of scope and requirements and effective execution for optimal outcomes. A background as a system or business analyst could be beneficial.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to thrive in dynamic environments, quickly adapting to evolving project requirements and priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail-oriented organization:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional attention to detail and organizational skills, enabling you to manage multiple tasks and projects concurrently without compromising quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even if you don’t fit 100% of the above criteria, feel free to apply anyway! We’re looking for someone who’s eager to learn, and we’ll provide all the mentoring and support you might need.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary. We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work location. Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remote work. Spend up to 30 days per year working remotely from abroad.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off. More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical insurance allowance. Enjoy peace of mind for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities. Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language classes. Pick up the local language or sharpen your English skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fuel your day. Enjoy a hot meal or receive a lunch allowance on workdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health support. To help you feel your best, we provide easy access to professional mental health services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sports benefit. Enjoy an on-site gym or sports club stipend.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events. Join company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Some benefits may vary depending on location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-KL1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
